// An orc: a swordsman. The orc archer's body (assets/art/orc_archer.ron,
// drawn from the user's reference) without its cowl and bow: a bald green
// skull with a dark crest of stubble, a long ear laid back, a heavy brow
// over a slit of amber eye, the jaw thrust out and its tusk; green
// shoulders hunched up behind its head, the strap and buckle across its
// chest, the belt and torn tabard, the iron pauldron on its far shoulder,
// wraps at the wrists, big clawed hands (its cleaver in the near one:
// weapons.ron). Its legs are its creature file's `legs` (legs.rs, `rig`),
// its run in step with them. On the humanoid rig's letters and parts, so
// what it wears goes on it: `head`/`blink` (caps and helms), `torso` and
// its t/T/L tabard and b belt (jerkins, mail), `arm_near` (pauldrons),
// `arm*` and their Z/S/s/W hands and m/M wraps (gloves). Facing right; the
// game mirrors it.
